failure_location.quote:
The amplification factor $G$ satisfying
\begin{equation}
G(\infty)=0, 
\label{G_infty}
\end{equation}
if and only if
\begin{equation}
C+D=0,
\label{L_stable_Condition}
\end{equation}

If and only if
\begin{equation}
C\geq0 \quad \text{or}\quad C<-\frac{1}{39},
\end{equation}

where the optimal parameter 
\begin{equation}
C = 0.018924
\label{C_value}
\end{equation}
 provides superior numerical damping characteristics.
